{"id":"geruch","lemma":"Geruch","pos":"noun","rank":2100,"glosses":["smell, odour","sense of smell, olfaction","(figurative, dated) reputation"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈʁʊχ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a4/De-Geruch.ogg/De-Geruch.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Geruches","plural":"Gerüche"},"examples":[{"text":"Was ist das für ein Geruch?","en":"What's that smell?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394446","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ich mag den Geruch von Pizza.","en":"I like the smell of pizza.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"pizza"}]},{"text":"Der Geruch macht mich krank.","en":"The smell's making me sick.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"ill, sick"}]},{"text":"Hast du den Geruch sofort erkannt?","en":"Did you immediately recognize the smell?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"immediately, at once"},{"g":"to recognize, perceive","l":"erkennen"}]},{"text":"Der Geruch war schrecklich.","en":"The smell was horrible.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"awfully, terribly"}]}]}